 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are things with you?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.67,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm well, thanks.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.61,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_25"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My spice drawer is chaos. I bought paprika three times because I couldn't find it.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Classic. First, pull everything out and toss anything that smells like dust, spices fade after a couple of years.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.74,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's half of them.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.63,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then that's already a win. Put the rest in alphabetical order, or group them by cuisine if that's how you cook.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 1.15,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Alphabetical. I'm a librarian.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then you'll be in your element. Labels on the lids help if they're lying flat in a drawer.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.81,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hold on, really?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_11",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Let me double-check. I'd still stand by it, but tell me what you heard.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.96,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Oh, lids. Of course. I've been",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "cleaning.dlg11"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "pulling every jar out to read the side.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.47,
